OL,3,GNEWSATown's last asylum hotel to close,
OL,4,AMP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last hotel housing asylum seekers
OL,7,Fin Crewe will be closed in the coming
OL,8,Fmonths, a local MP has said.
OL,10,FConnor Naismith, who represents Crewe
OL,11,Fand Nantwich, said he had received
OL,12,Fconfirmation from the Home Office that
OL,13,Fthe Royal Hotel would no longer be used
OL,14,Fas asylum accommodation.
OL,16,FIt comes almost seven months after the
OL,17,Fnearby Crewe Arms Hotel reopened to the
OL,18,Fpublic after it stopped housing asylum
OL,19,Fseekers.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
