OL,3,GNEWSATown's last asylum hotel to close,
OL,4,AMP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said it was working to
OL,7,Ffairly house asylum seekers across the
OL,8,Fcountry while addressing the concerns
OL,9,Fof local communities by closing asylum
OL,10,Fhotels and using alternative sites.
